@startuml
title National Voice - Sequence diagram for national voice with extra product

participant "SmartPhone" as Phone #purple
participant "NetworkFunction" as NF #lightblue
participant "OCS_ChargingFunction" as OCF #lightblue

box "ServiceBalanceManagement"
  participant "OCS_AccountBalanceMgmt" as ABMF #blue
  participant "OCS_RatingFunction" as RF #blue
end box

box "ServiceUsageManagement"
  participant "OCS_ChargingDataFunction" as CDF #blue
  participant "OCS_ChargingGatewayFunction" as CGF #blue
end box

Phone -> NF : 1 start voice call
activate NF
note right of NF : Voice call starts 7:55:05 PM
NF -> OCF : 2 authorize voice call
activate OCF

OCF -> CDF : 3 Open CDR
CDF --> OCF : 4 CDR Opened

OCF -> ABMF : 5 get applicable balances for service
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 6 balances for service retrieved
ABMF --> OCF : 7
deactivate ABMF

OCF -> RF : 8 determine value of the session and pass in balances
activate RF
RF -> RF : 9 value determined based on\nparameters and service details.\nincrement change detected
note right of CDF : 60s increment used before 8PM and\n30s increment used after 8PM
RF --> OCF : 10 value established including expiry time for current calculation
deactivate RF

OCF -> OCF : 11 determine reservation amount
note right of OCF : value determined as 5*60

OCF -> ABMF : 12 reserve balance
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 13 balance reservation added
ABMF --> OCF : 14 balance reservation successful
deactivate ABMF

OCF --> NF : 15 authorize session; expiry time 8:00:05 PM
note right of OCF : re-athorization required to account\nfor the upcoming change in increments
NF --> Phone : 16 start voice call
note left of Phone : User starts the call

Phone -> NF : 17 voice call continues
note left of NF : Time for increment change reached.\nRe-athorization required
NF -> OCF : 18 re-authorize voice call

OCF -> OCF : 19 determine the final value for the first increment
note right of ABMF : value and rules already known

OCF -> ABMF : 20 debit balance
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 21 balance debited
note right of CDF : final amount for first part debited based on 60s increment
ABMF --> OCF : 22 balance debit successful
deactivate ABMF

OCF -> RF : 23 determine value of the session
activate RF
note right of CDF : 30s increment used after 8PM
RF -> RF : 24 value determined based on\nparameters and service details.\nincrement change detected
RF --> OCF : 25 value established including expiry time for current calculation
deactivate RF

OCF -> OCF : 26 determine reservation amount
note right of OCF : reservation amount established based on 30s increment

OCF -> ABMF : 27 reserve balance
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 28 balance reservation added
ABMF --> OCF : 29 balance reservation successful
deactivate ABMF

OCF --> NF : 30 authorize session
NF --> Phone : 31 voice call continues

Phone -> NF : 32 voice call ends
note left of NF : User ends call at 8:09:23 PM
NF -> OCF : 33 finalize voice call

OCF -> OCF : 34 determine final value

OCF -> ABMF : 35 debit balance
activate ABMF
note right of ABMF : debits the balance and\nreleases any unused reservation
ABMF -> ABMF : 36 balance debited
ABMF --> OCF : 37 debit balance successful
deactivate ABMF

OCF --> NF : 38 finalization completed
deactivate NF

OCF -> CDF : 39 Close CDR
activate CDF
CDF -> CGF : 40 Finalized CDR
note right of CGF : the finalized event including information\non the increment change is stored and\navailable for further distribution
CDF --> OCF : 41 CDR Closed
deactivate CDF
deactivate OCF

@enduml
